{"title":"Rock Scorpion","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 29 Scorpion that attacks with stab (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">corrode</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: carapaceFlat: 2 | venomChance: .3 | venomDamage: 12</p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>6</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rock-scorpion?lv=32\" title=\"Pick level 32\"><td><b>32</b></td><td>131</td><td>22.1</td><td>1,600</td><td class=\"muted\">393 · 30.9 · 4,800</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Old%20Thak%20Muster%20Ground\">Old Thak Muster Ground</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Marauder%20Warcamp\">Marauder Warcamp</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Scorpion%20Pits\">Scorpion Pits</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Boneyard%20Roost\">Boneyard Roost</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 3 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rock-scorpion\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Scorpion: <a href=\"#/monster/dune-scorpion\">Dune Scorpion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/deathstalker-scorpion\">Deathstalker Scorpion</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/5fab85beeea545234ca0.webp\" alt=\"Rock Scorpion\"></div><h3>Rock Scorpion</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>29 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 29–32)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Scorpion</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>stab · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>111</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>20.5</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1450</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>26 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}